{
  "$schema": "../schemas/pure-admin-theme.schema.json",
  "name": "Dark",
  "id": "dark",
  "version": "2.7.0",
  "description": "Dark-only theme with neutral gray base and four color tints (default blue, blue, green, red)",
  "content": "## Dark\n\nA dark-only theme — four color-tinted variants of the same dark base. The default palette uses soft blue accents on neutral grays; switch to a tinted variant for a different mood while staying in dark mode.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- **Four tints** — Default (neutral gray), Blue (slate), Green, Red\n- **Dark only** — no light mode; for a light/dark-toggleable theme see Corporate or Minimal\n- **Neutral gray base** that works well with any content\n- **Play** font family for a modern technical feel\n\n### Variants\n\nApply a variant by adding a CSS class to `<body>`:\n\n```html\n<body>                          <!-- Default (neutral gray) -->\n<body class=\"pa-color-blue\">    <!-- slate blue tint -->\n<body class=\"pa-color-green\">   <!-- green tint -->\n<body class=\"pa-color-red\">     <!-- red tint -->\n```\n\n### Usage\n\n```html\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/dark.css\">\n```",
  "author": "KeenMate",
  "license": "MIT",

  "modeCssClass": "pa-mode-{mode}",
  "variantCssClass": "pa-color-{variant}",

  "colorVariants": [
    {
      "id": "",
      "name": "Default",
      "description": "Neutral gray with blue accent",
      "file": "dist/dark.css",
      "modes": [
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "name": "Dark",
          "default": true,
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#4dabf7",
            "background": "#1a1a1a",
            "surface": "#2a2a2a",
            "text": "#ffffff",
            "header": "#2d2d2d",
            "sidebar": "#242424"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "blue",
      "name": "Blue",
      "description": "Slate blue tinted backgrounds",
      "file": "dist/dark.css",
      "modes": [
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "name": "Dark",
          "default": true,
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#3b82f6",
            "background": "#0f172a",
            "surface": "#1e293b",
            "text": "#ffffff",
            "header": "#0f172a",
            "sidebar": "#1e293b"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "green",
      "name": "Green",
      "description": "Green tinted backgrounds",
      "file": "dist/dark.css",
      "modes": [
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "name": "Dark",
          "default": true,
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#22c55e",
            "background": "#0f1e13",
            "surface": "#1a2e1f",
            "text": "#ffffff",
            "header": "#0f1e13",
            "sidebar": "#1a2e1f"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "red",
      "name": "Red",
      "description": "Red tinted backgrounds",
      "file": "dist/dark.css",
      "modes": [
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "name": "Dark",
          "default": true,
          "colors": {
            "accent": "#ef4444",
            "background": "#1f0f0f",
            "surface": "#2d1a1a",
            "text": "#ffffff",
            "header": "#1f0f0f",
            "sidebar": "#2d1a1a"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "fonts": {
    "family": "Play, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif",
    "url": "https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Play",
    "files": [
      { "family": "Play", "src": "assets/fonts/play-400-latin.woff2", "weight": 400, "style": "normal" },
      { "family": "Play", "src": "assets/fonts/play-400-latin-ext.woff2", "weight": 400, "style": "normal" },
      { "family": "Play", "src": "assets/fonts/play-700-latin.woff2", "weight": 700, "style": "normal" },
      { "family": "Play", "src": "assets/fonts/play-700-latin-ext.woff2", "weight": 700, "style": "normal" }
    ]
  },

  "features": {
    "cssVariables": true,
    "darkMode": true,
    "lightMode": false,
    "responsiveLayout": true,
    "compactMode": true,
    "sidebarCollapse": true,
    "sidebarIconMode": true,
    "customFonts": true,
    "rtlSupport": false,
    "printStyles": false
  },

  "exports": {
    "css": "./dist/dark.css",
    "scss": "./src/scss/dark.scss"
  },

  "dependencies": {
    "core": "^2.7.0"
  }
}
